# NOTE: Cloudflare Pages _redirects only supports relative URLs.
# www -> apex is configured at the CF dashboard via Rules -> Redirect Rules.

# Root is handled by src/pages/index.astro, which detects browser language
# client-side and redirects to /zh/ or /en/. We deliberately do NOT add a
# `/ /en/ 302` edge redirect here — that would bypass the language detection.

# Convenience top-level shortcuts
/download /en/download/ 302
/features /en/features/ 302
/docs /en/docs/getting-started/ 302
/privacy /en/privacy/ 302
/terms /en/terms/ 302
